/**
 * @class StSvtClusterMatrix
 * @ingroup StSvtSimulationMaker
 * @brief Heap-allocated resizable 2-D matrix of doubles for cluster data.
 *
 * Stores a `mCluRow × mCluCol` matrix allocated on the heap.  Supports
 * resize (SetDimension()), copy construction, operator() access, and
 * stream input.
 *
 * ### Data Members
 * | Member | Type | Description |
 * |--------|------|-------------|
 * | mCluRow | int | Number of rows |
 * | mCluCol | int | Number of columns |
 * | mData | double** | Row-major data array |
 */

// =========================================================================

/**
 * @class StSvtEnergySim
 * @ingroup StSvtSimulationMaker
 * @brief Test-particle energy and momentum generator (not used in production).
 *
 * Generates an array of StParticle objects with random energies drawn from
 * an exponential or Gaussian distribution and isotropic momentum directions.
 *
 * ### StParticle struct
 * | Field | Type | Description |
 * |-------|------|-------------|
 * | mass | float | Particle mass [MeV/c²] |
 * | energy | float | Total energy [MeV] |
 * | momentum | float | Total momentum magnitude |
 * | momentumZ | float | Z-component of momentum |
 * | momentumXY | float | Transverse momentum |
 * | momentumX | float | X-component of momentum |
 * | momentumY | float | Y-component of momentum |
 * | theta | float | Polar angle [rad] |
 * | phi | float | Azimuthal angle [rad] |
 */

// =========================================================================

/**
 * @class StSvtTable
 * @ingroup StSvtSimulationMaker
 * @brief Pre-computed look-up table of Gaussian probability integrals.
 *
 * Stores a 1000×2000 matrix `mFreq[j][k]` where
 * @f$\texttt{mFreq}[j][k] = \Phi\!\bigl((j\cdot0.001+i)/k\cdot0.001\bigr)@f$
 * for a given integer base `i` set by setFreq(i).
 *
 * In practice, StSvtSignal uses the direct erf/erfc functions; this class
 * is a legacy utility retained for historical reference.
 *
 * ### Data Members
 * | Member | Type | Description |
 * |--------|------|-------------|
 * | mFreq[1000][2000] | double | Tabulated CDF values |
 */
